# Placeholder for docker-compose's `extra_ca` build secret.
#
# This file contains no certificate, so both Dockerfiles skip their CA step and
# build normally. To trust an extra CA on a network behind a TLS-inspecting
# proxy, point EXTRA_CA_CERT at a real PEM bundle instead:
#
#   EXTRA_CA_CERT=/path/to/ca-bundle.crt docker compose build
